## Add Domain Search cache switch and request cache override

Context: Lakehouse and Lakebase searches (Explorer, GraphQL, MCP
`describe_entity`) used adjacency / entity-search / props companions whenever
those tables existed. There was no domain switch and no per-request override,
so Views-only Lakehouse could still read a stale snapshot, and operators could
not force live SPO. This adds one Search cache control (default on), pending
rebuild after re-enable, and a `cache` query/body flag that always wins.

Changes:

1. `src/back/core/graphdb/search_cache.py`
   Policy helpers: parse `cache`, resolve auto/force_on/force_off, rebuild skip,
   mark ready/pending.
2. `src/back/core/graphdb/GraphDBBackend.py`
   Gate `adjacency_ready` / `entity_search_ready` / props reads on the request
   mode; `cache=true` with missing companions raises ValidationError.
3. `src/back/objects/session/DomainSession.py`, `src/back/objects/domain/Domain.py`
   Persist `graph_cache_enabled` / `graph_cache_state`; new domains pending;
   legacy import missing keys → enabled+ready; re-enable → pending_refresh.
4. `src/front/templates/partials/domain/_domain_information.html`,
   `src/front/static/domain/js/domain-information.js`,
   `src/front/static/domain/js/domain.js`,
   `src/front/static/global/js/navbar.js`
   Backend tab Search cache switch (Lakehouse/Lakebase) on both save paths.
5. `src/api/routers/digitaltwin.py`, `src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py`,
   `src/back/fastapi/graphql_routes.py`, `src/mcp-server/server/tools.py`
   `cache` on public/session find, filter, GraphQL, MCP describe_entity;
   find responses include `cache_used` / `cache_mode`.
6. Rebuild callers (`_build_pipeline.py`, Delta pipeline, DigitalTwin refresh,
   `cache_refresh.py`, ReasoningService, CohortBuilder, Lakebase/Delta purge)
   skip companion rebuild when the switch is off; Refresh cache fails if
   disabled.
7. `docs/user-guide.md`, `docs/features.md`, `docs/optimizations.md`
   Document the switch and request override.
8. Unit tests for policy, UI contract, session round-trip, purge skip, and
   Preview seed gating under the new ready checks.

